WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,680 --> 00:00:04,280
It was very dangerous that time in Yunwu Mountain, right?

2
00:00:07,690 --> 00:00:09,490
I can help you apply to stay in Zhongzhou

3
00:00:09,690 --> 00:00:14,140
It's better to just become a police officer

4
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:16,470
Executives should do meaningful things

5
00:00:16,870 --> 00:00:22,470
Fighting against monsters and demons is what I want to do

6
00:00:22,870 --> 00:00:28,890
Classmate Wen Chen, you

7
00:00:29,290 --> 00:00:32,770
Not participating, not considering

8
00:00:32,970 --> 00:00:34,970
I'm here for a training course. It's not suitable for me to leave.

9
00:00:35,170 --> 00:00:37,170
No, no, no, just stay here with him.

10
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:41,300
There are four competitions in total

11
00:00:41,700 --> 00:00:44,100
The top three districts can also represent Zhongzhou in the five-week competition

12
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:52,270
The use of firearms is random and will only be known during the match.
